name: Source-bound database preparation and partial CodeQL observations refuse raw and stale inputs
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: help
require-live-snap: 20 HELP | help-open
paste-file: @ART/create.txt
require-live-snap: 20 timeoutMs | create-draft-tail
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 run codeql:create-db | create-draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | execution-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 40 built a rust database | database-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py create @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/create-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Source commit | database-receipt
ask: Does preparation disclose repository-execution consent, exact source commit and scope without claiming a completed Map or finding verdict?
paste-file: @ART/scan.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 codeql: 1 finding | observations-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py scan @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/scan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | query-receipt
expect: independent review
resize: 160x48
live-snap: query-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: query-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: query-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: query-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | query-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: query-paged-40x12
ask: Are query authority, scope limits, finding evidence and paging understandable at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/raw.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 no trusted provenance | raw-database-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py dirty @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/scan.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 clean | dirty-source-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py refused @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Do raw-database and changed-source refusals give actionable explanations while preserving earlier observations without claiming they were fixed?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-confirmation
expect: no active work
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | resumed
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
paste-file: @ART/scan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered-query
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/codeql_modules.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the exact historical query receipt and source limitations without starting builds or changing finding verdicts?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
